From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "packet-boats[bot]"
 <346322443+packet-boats[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 08:38:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Name the program chantey

sing-box's licence asks that a derivative work not use its name or imply
association with it. The command, its version line, its run messages,
and what it reports over the Clash API, the SSM API and its User-Agent
now say chantey.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: packet-boats[bot] <346322443+packet-boats[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 cmd/sing-box/cmd.go                        | 2 +-
 cmd/sing-box/cmd_api_openconnect_auth.go   | 2 +-
